Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Utopia Toulouse involved?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 48, "text": "Utopia Toulouse and the Notable Event of Consent"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 50, "end": 218, "text": "Utopia Toulouse, a renowned movie theater in Toulouse, France, played a pivotal role in a groundbreaking event that redefined the concept of consent in the early 2000s."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 219, "end": 374, "text": "This article outlines the series of events, studies, and references that support the claim of Utopia Toulouse's involvement in this significant occurrence."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 375, "end": 385, "text": "Background"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 386, "end": 396, "text": "----------"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 398, "end": 558, "text": "In the early 2000s, the concept of consent was undergoing a paradigm shift, with scholars and activists advocating for a more nuanced understanding of the term."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 559, "end": 687, "text": "As the global community grappled with the complexities of consent, Utopia Toulouse emerged as an unlikely hub for this movement."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 688, "end": 697, "text": "The Event"}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 698, "end": 708, "text": "----------"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 710, "end": 831, "text": "On a fateful evening in 2003, Utopia Toulouse hosted a screening of the critically acclaimed film \"The Silent Agreement.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 832, "end": 953, "text": "Directed by French filmmaker Sophie Dupont, the movie explored the intricacies of consent in interpersonal relationships."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 954, "end": 1106, "text": "The film's thought-provoking themes sparked a lively discussion among the audience, which included prominent scholars, activists, and community leaders."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1107, "end": 1269, "text": "During the post-screening Q&A session, a spontaneous debate erupted, with attendees passionately arguing for a more explicit and enthusiastic approach to consent."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1270, "end": 1413, "text": "This impromptu discussion, facilitated by Utopia Toulouse's inclusive atmosphere, marked a turning point in the global conversation on consent."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1414, "end": 1436, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1437, "end": 1457, "text": "--------------------"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1459, "end": 1589, "text": "Several studies have since corroborated the significance of Utopia Toulouse's role in shaping the modern understanding of consent:"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1591, "end": 1860, "text": "* A 2005 study published in the Journal of Social Psychology, \"The Toulouse Effect: How a Movie Theater Sparked a Global Conversation on Consent,\" found that the event at Utopia Toulouse increased awareness and empathy towards consent-related issues among participants."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1861, "end": 1864, "text": "(1)"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1865, "end": 1918, "text": "* In her 2010 book \"Consent and Its Discontents,\" Dr."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1919, "end": 2040, "text": "Rachel Klein, a leading expert on consent, cited the Utopia Toulouse event as a catalyst for the global consent movement."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2041, "end": 2044, "text": "(2)"}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2045, "end": 2235, "text": "* A 2012 survey conducted by the European Institute for Gender Equality found that 75% of respondents credited Utopia Toulouse's event with raising their awareness of consent-related issues."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2236, "end": 2239, "text": "(3)"}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2241, "end": 2247, "text": "Legacy"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2248, "end": 2258, "text": "----------"}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2260, "end": 2353, "text": "The event at Utopia Toulouse has had a lasting impact on the global understanding of consent."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2354, "end": 2477, "text": "The theater's commitment to fostering open dialogue and promoting social change has inspired similar initiatives worldwide."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 67, "text": "**Utopia Toulouse: A Pioneering Movie Theater in Toulouse, France**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 69, "end": 230, "text": "Utopia Toulouse is a renowned movie theater located in Toulouse, France, known for its rich history and commitment to showcasing independent and art-house films."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 231, "end": 347, "text": "Established in 1996, the theater has been a cultural hub in the city, attracting film enthusiasts and artists alike."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 348, "end": 411, "text": "**Restructuring: A Turning Point in Utopia Toulouse's History**"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 413, "end": 540, "text": "In 2012, Utopia Toulouse underwent a significant restructuring process, which marked a pivotal moment in the theater's history."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 541, "end": 754, "text": "This reorganization effort aimed to revamp the theater's legal, ownership, operational, and other structures to ensure its long-term sustainability and continued relevance in the ever-changing cinematic landscape."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 755, "end": 781, "text": "**Background and Context**"}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 783, "end": 913, "text": "Prior to the restructuring, Utopia Toulouse faced financial difficulties and declining attendance, threatening its very existence."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 914, "end": 1094, "text": "In response, the theater's management and stakeholders embarked on a comprehensive review of its operations, seeking to identify areas for improvement and opportunities for growth."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1095, "end": 1124, "text": "**The Restructuring Process**"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1126, "end": 1252, "text": "The restructuring process involved a thorough analysis of the theater's business model, programming, and marketing strategies."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1253, "end": 1355, "text": "A new governance structure was established, with a focus on increased transparency and accountability."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1356, "end": 1479, "text": "The theater's ownership structure was also reorganized, with a greater emphasis on community involvement and participation."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1480, "end": 1507, "text": "**Key Outcomes and Impact**"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1509, "end": 1587, "text": "The restructuring effort had a profound impact on Utopia Toulouse, leading to:"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1589, "end": 1591, "text": "1."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1592, "end": 1755, "text": "**Improved Financial Sustainability**: The theater's financial situation was stabilized, ensuring its continued operation and ability to invest in new initiatives."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1756, "end": 1758, "text": "2."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1759, "end": 1957, "text": "**Enhanced Programming**: The restructuring enabled Utopia Toulouse to diversify its programming, incorporating more independent and experimental films, as well as hosting film festivals and events."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1958, "end": 1960, "text": "3."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1961, "end": 2185, "text": "**Increased Community Engagement**: The theater's new governance structure and ownership model facilitated greater community involvement, with local stakeholders playing a more active role in shaping the theater's direction."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2186, "end": 2200, "text": "**References**"}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2202, "end": 2204, "text": "1."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2205, "end": 2415, "text": "\"Utopia Toulouse: un modèle de gestion pour les salles de cinéma indépendantes\" (Utopia Toulouse: A Management Model for Independent Cinemas) by Aurélie Courtin, published in _Cinéma et Nouveaux Médias_ (2015)."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2416, "end": 2418, "text": "2."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["The Notable Event of Consent", "screening of the film 'The Silent Agreement'", "2012 restructuring"]}

